{"type":"standard","title":"Scott Colom","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Scott Colom</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q115492489","titles":{"canonical":"Scott_Colom","normalized":"Scott Colom","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Scott Colom</span></span>"},"pageid":72007761,"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1375679412","tid":"44aa22f7-b406-11f1-9eb2-c40673c4354c","timestamp":"2026-09-19T08:44:04Z","description":"American lawyer (born 1982)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scott_Colom","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scott_Colom?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scott_Colom?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Scott_Colom"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scott_Colom","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Scott_Colom","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Scott_Colom?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Scott_Colom"}},"extract":"Scott Winston Colom is an American lawyer and jurist serving as the district attorney for the 16th Judicial District of Mississippi. He is a former nominee to serve as a United States district judge of the United States District Court for the Northern District of Mississippi.","extract_html":"<p><b>Scott Winston Colom</b> is an American lawyer and jurist serving as the district attorney for the 16th Judicial District of Mississippi. He is a former nominee to serve as a United States district judge of the United States District Court for the Northern District of Mississippi.</p>"}